1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,530
Meskerem 2012 (late 2019).

2
00:00:02,530 --> 00:00:04,610
At midday I left Ankober.

3
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:06,530
Just one backpack.

4
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:07,783
A friend saw me off.

5
00:00:08,483 --> 00:00:10,983
A gravel road as far as Debre Birhan.

6
00:00:10,983 --> 00:00:12,617
After that, asphalt.

7
00:00:13,317 --> 00:00:15,367
I sat by the window.

8
00:00:15,367 --> 00:00:17,577
Outside, only forest and mountain.

9
00:00:17,577 --> 00:00:19,617
The view amazed me.

10
00:00:20,317 --> 00:00:22,877
I reached Lamberet after dark.

11
00:00:22,877 --> 00:00:24,847
My friend was there, waiting for me.

12
00:00:24,847 --> 00:00:28,617
People, lights, cars,
everything at once.

13
00:00:33,317 --> 00:00:36,567
At Autobus Tera the
brokers closed in on us.

14
00:00:36,567 --> 00:00:38,377
"Do you want a bed?" "A bed?"

15
00:00:38,377 --> 00:00:40,047
From every side. We were lost.

16
00:00:40,047 --> 00:00:42,617
In the end we picked one.

17
00:00:43,317 --> 00:00:45,287
One bed in the room.

18
00:00:45,287 --> 00:00:47,557
Not very good, not bad.

19
00:00:47,557 --> 00:00:50,617
But clean.

20
00:00:51,317 --> 00:00:56,117
In the morning we stood in a
long queue and got the ticket.

21
00:00:56,817 --> 00:01:02,437
Today, remembering that first night,
I tell all who leave home one thing:

22
00:01:02,437 --> 00:01:04,817
the first night is always confusing.

23
00:01:04,817 --> 00:01:07,617
Do not run from it. Savour it.

